{{x}_{1}(t)+2{x}_{2}(t)+5\\}\\end{aligned}\\,\\,\n$$\n\nUsing the derivative property of the Laplace transform, we obtain the system\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}sL\\{{x}_{1}(t)\\}-{x}_{1}(0)=3L\\{{x}_{1}(t)\\}+L\\{{t}^{2}\\}-4L\\{1\\} \\\\ sL\\{{x}_{2}(t)\\}-{x}_{2}(0)=L\\{{x}_{1}(t)\\}+2L\\{{x}_{2}(t)\\}+5L\\{1\\}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, using the results\n\n$$\nL\\{1\\}=\\frac{1}{s},\\,L\\{{t}^{2}\\}=\\frac{2}{{s}^{3}},\n$$\n\n we can write our system as follows:\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}s{X}_{1}(s)+1=3{X}_{1}(s)+\\frac{2}{{s}^{3}}-\\frac{4}{s} \\\\ s{X}_{2}(s)-2={X}_{1}(s)+2{X}_{2}(s)+\\frac{5}{s}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere ${X}_{1}(s)=L\\{{x}_{1}(t)\\}$ and ${X}_{2}(s)=L\\{{x}_{2}(t)\\}$ are the Laplace transforms of the functions ${x}_{1}(t)$ and ${x}_{2}(t),$ respectively."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186434057 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186166933 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ca890a8e-9ddd-51f7-9784-c9c1f020adef" :knowledge-point/title "Applying the Laplace Transform to a System of Linear ODEs"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "124f31b6-16be-59af-9399-945eb2972e96" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{s}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186433971} {:answer/id #uuid "53f894cf-b4b4-5ea2-ac5d-69cb9357ba44" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{4}{s}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186433988} {:answer/id #uuid "5fc8f59b-910b-569f-a06f-e30f835c55d0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{s}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186433991} {:answer/id #uuid "a57fd19f-ecbd-54d8-9bbe-8b264bf6875c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{2}{s}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186434015}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "124f31b6-16be-59af-9399-945eb2972e96" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answe